  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, Star Snail Hall is the corpse of a star sea snail. The first generation Combat Beast King killed that snail at the cost of his own life. The current Combat Beast King plans to merge with the star sea snail’s shell to transport warriors into battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shell-as-hall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven",
        "house_star_snail_hall",
        "char_combat_beast_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The star sea snail was an immemorial desolate beast; the body before Fang Yuan is only its corpse. Beast Calamity Immortal was fatally wounded fighting it and, on his deathbed, forged the corpse into the final inheritance ground. Although the snail is dead, its shell still retains a vast number of star path dao marks that the Combat Beast King can use. After the fight, the shell is left cracked; Fang Yuan examines the profundities within it.",
      "chapters": [
        1689
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "corpse-and-dao-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_beast_calamity_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After annexing Beast Calamity grotto-heaven, Fang Yuan builds a new mortal Gu House as Star Snail Hall and puts the Star Sea Snail that originally served as the hall into his treasury. The snail is an immemorial desolate beast, and its shell is a rank eight immortal material. He judges that leaving it with the old Combat Beast King would only let the dao marks dissipate naturally, which would be wasteful.",
      "chapters": [
        1919
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-material",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu_house"
      ]
    }
  ],
